						732580203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Messily-Written Note"
				},
				{
					"id": 732580203,
					"content": "\"...Everybody loves them. The golden one is like a big sun and the silver one is like a little moon, gentle and bright...\"",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Messily-Written Note"
